Package: tabame
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Far Se <tabame-release@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: libgtk-3-0, libnotify4, libx11-6, libstdc++6
Description: Tabame desktop launcher and quick menu
 Tabame provides a searchable launcher, quick menu, plugins, and portable
 desktop utilities. Advanced window and input features depend on the display
 server and are reported as capabilities at runtime.
